File: src/fit_mesg.cpp
Function: Mesg::GetFieldByIndex
One decode of the test corpus takes about 358.729 ms.

Rewrite this function to make decoding faster:
```cpp
Field* Mesg::GetFieldByIndex(const FIT_UINT16 index)
{
    if (index < fields.size())
        return &fields[index];

    return FIT_NULL;
}
```
